/*
 * Declares the TemplateContext and TemplateSpecialization classs, which
 * manage semantic-validation state for template instantiation and template
 * specialization resolution.
 *
 * TemplateContext tracks all template instantiations performed during the
 * semantic pass. It ensures that:
 *   - identical template instantiations are not recomputed,
 *   - template rewrites are memoized,
 *   - template lookups are performed efficiently,
 *   - and recursive template instantiation is handled safely.
 *
 * TemplateSpecialization stores the metadata associated with a single
 * template instantiation: the mapper used, the source location, the
 * resulting symbol, and the referent symbol used for matching.

 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::context::template_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/context/template_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-18
